 "description": "<p>A two-tone bridal set: veil, top, skirt, and sleeves in polyester, offered in white or black. The choice between them changes the mood completely - white plays the wedding-night reference straight, black turns it into a costume statement.</p>\n<p>Four pieces is the right number for this genre. The veil says bride, the skirt carries the silhouette, the sleeves add formality, and the top holds the structure. All in chiffon-weight polyester, so the whole set packs smaller than a single satin gown would.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: veil, top, skirt, sleeves</li>\n<li>Style: bride, two-tone option</li>\n<li>Color: white or black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Pick black if the white version reads too literal for the occasion you have in mind.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Bridal chiffon set with veil, top, skirt and sleeves in white or black, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
